    "final_diagnosis": "Anaphylaxis",
    "differentials": ["Acute asthma exacerbation", "Vasovagal syncope", "Panic attack", "Angioedema (non-allergic)"],
    "explanation": "Rapid-onset airway (throat tightness, stridor), breathing (wheeze) and circulatory (hypotension) compromise with urticaria minutes after a known allergen exposure is diagnostic of anaphylaxis."
