      "Intramuscular adrenaline 0.5 mg (1:1000) into the anterolateral thigh, repeat after 5 minutes if needed",
      "High-flow oxygen",
      "IV fluid bolus for hypotension",
      "Adjuncts after adrenaline: antihistamine and consider steroids"
